Description: feature-rich WhatsApp Web client for Linux
 Whatsie is a desktop client for WhatsApp Web built with Qt and Qt
 WebEngine. It provides desktop integration including notifications,
 downloads, themes, privacy controls, application locking, and system
 tray support.
